{"styles":[{"sc":"#ff2600","so":1,"w":2,"ol":true,"fc":"#fffb00","fo":0.502}],"cards":["<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#222222;max-width:238px;\"><div style=\"background:#0e7d46;height:6px;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#0e7d46;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;padding:7px 0 0;\">COUNTY BOUNDARY</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#0e7d46;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;padding:0 0 2px;\">PENNSYLVANIA</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 0 6px;\">Mifflin County</div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;\"><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Population</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">46,000 (2025 est.)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">County Seat</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">Lewistown</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Land Area</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">411 sq mi</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Density</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">112 / sq mi</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Median Household Income</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">$64,000</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Median Home Value</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">$155,000</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#333333;padding:8px 0 2px;border-top:1px solid #eef2f1;margin-top:7px;\">Mifflin County lies in central Pennsylvania's ridge-and-valley country, where the Juniata River collects Kishacoquillas Creek at Lewistown and ridges enclose Big Valley, farmed by Amish and Mennonite families. Manufacturing in th